-- Source: all_india_pincode_directory_2025.csv (India Post, 2025)
-- Depends: 08b_postal_code_bulk.sql (parent PINs must exist first)
-- Note: ALL post offices per PIN -> nss.post_office (child of
--       nss.postal_code; reinstated table, see Foundation
--       01_foundation/13_post_office.sql). Each office is joined
--       to its parent PIN at load time; offices whose PIN has no
--       parent row (state did not resolve in the postal_code
--       load) are skipped by the JOIN. All rows are seeded as
--       entry_status='APPROVED' (table default) -- this is
--       reference data, not a member submission. Idempotent via
--       the approved-only partial unique index
--       uq_post_office_pin_name_approved.
-- =====================================================

